COMPILATION OF: E35N2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E35N2

   1 a 0000 e35n2: procedure options(main);
   2 c 0006   declare sysin file, n fixed;
   3 c 000D   n = 0;
   4 c 0013   on endfile(sysin) goto h;
   5 c 0021   goto a;
   6 c 0024 a: n = n + 1;
   7 c 002B   goto b;
   8 c 002E b: n = n + 2;
   9 c 0036   revert endfile(sysin);
  10 c 003E   goto h;
  11 c 0048 h: n = n + 4;
  12 c 0052   put list('n=', n);
  13 c 0074   stop;
  14 a 0077 end e35n2;

CODE SIZE = 0077
DATA AREA = 0006
FREE SYMS = 3858
END  COMPILATION
